[msg MSG_020_1 speaker 0] // {firstname 3}
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Oh, you're back.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}Um, {firstname 0}...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}You know that special report at
the beginning of the magazine?
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}Well, it says some things that are
a little disturbing.
{wait}

[msg MSG_020_2 speaker 0] // {firstname 3}
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}According to the report, there's
a group of demon worshippers
who call themselves the Gaea cult...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}They're right here in Japan.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}Anyway, they believe in
this book of prophecy called
the Scripture of Miroku.
{wait}

[msg MSG_020_2B speaker 0] // {firstname 3}
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}In that book, it says that
chaos will befall the world,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}and these people are actually
trying to make that happen.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}The reporter was unable to learn
what is meant by "chaos"...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}It could be worldwide terrorism,
or some other tragedy. But...
{wait}

[msg MSG_020_3 speaker 0] // {firstname 3}
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}...Oh yeah, there's something else
you should know.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}When I told {firstname 2} about it,
he went off on his own to look for
Ms. {lastname 1} some more.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}He asked me to give you this.
I guess he found it somewhere
and just took it.
{wait}

[msg MSG_020_4]
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}> You obtained an {color 1}ID Card{color 0}.
{wait}

[msg MSG_020_5 speaker 0] // {firstname 3}
